+{
+  "id": "69292801e7b3ab7c07fcd418",
+  "title": "🏭Build Contest &amp; General Updates",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "valor-shop",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "miscellaneous"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey again @everyone. Time for a new build contest and a few quick general updates. 🏭Build Contest: Factory From deeply industrial to steampunk to magic and more! 🗓️ Due Date : Friday, December 12, 2025 11:59 PM PST. This is ~4 days longer…",
+  "date": "2025-11-27T22:46:08.403000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey again @everyone. Time for a new build contest and a few quick general updates.</p><h4>🏭Build Contest: Factory</h4><pre><code>From deeply industrial to steampunk to magic and more!</code></pre><ul><li><p>🗓️<strong>Due Date</strong>: Friday, December 12, 2025 11:59 PM PST. This is ~4 days longer than normal to account for Thanksgiving for those celebrating.</p><ul><li><p>This event is also listed on the <a href=\"/calendar/\">calendar</a>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Prize Info</strong>: Can be found <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1378477212805763112/1378477212805763112\">here</a>.</p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: Entrants for the top 3 submissions earn <strong>+1 Charms slot</strong> and <strong>5 Wind-up Keys</strong> from the Valor Gift Shop.</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🐺<em>Cerberus</em> now displays its loading phase progress on the action bar while it&#x27;s held in either form.</p></li><li><p>🤖Copper Golems are now automatically protected by whoever spawned them. This works retroactively.</p></li><li><p>💛<em>Curse of Bloodletting</em> now consumes Absorption hearts first if you have any.</p></li><li><p>🎄Early FYI that we&#x27;ll run our typical 12 Days of Christmas gift event next month. Fireplace registration will open closer to the event, though of course feel free to prep them now if you&#x27;d like!</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">🫶 Happy to see a decent number of you still hopping on this deep into the map. Much love!</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-general-updates.json b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-general-updates.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b44495f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-general-updates.json
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+{
+  "id": "689a138f889ba67da0d34b51",
+  "title": "⚒️Build Contest &amp; General Updates",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "gameplay"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone, been a while! Today we've got a new build contest kicking off, and a few general updates. 🍻Build Contest: Tavern",
+  "date": "2025-08-11T11:06:10.121000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey everyone, been a while! Today we&#x27;ve got a new build contest kicking off, and a few general updates. </p><h4>🍻Build Contest: Tavern</h4><p class=\"post-small\">A place for drinking, stories, perhaps sparring? Rustic inn, pirate bar, snowy lodge - whatever &quot;tavern&quot; means to you.</p><ul><li><p>📅<strong>Due Date</strong>: Thursday, August 21, 2025 1:59 AM CDT</p><ul><li><pre><code>This event is also listed on the <a href=\"/calendar/\">calendar</a>.</code></pre></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>✏️Prize Info</strong>: ⁠<a href=\"/changelog-and-faq/build-contest-overview/\">⚒ Build Contest Overview</a></p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: Entrants for the top 3 submissions earn <strong>+1 charm slot</strong> and a free <strong>Fermentation Barrel</strong> charm.</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🎃Pumpkins can now be carved in a stonecutter. This does not drop seeds like carving by hand does.</p></li><li><p> 🟩Slime and magma cube heads now drop more reliably. This also fixes them never dropping from the <em>Wishbone</em> charm.</p></li><li><p> 💎<strong>Boundary Shards</strong> can no longer be used in uncorruptible locales and don&#x27;t get you stuck in the disenchant mode once used at the Arcanum.</p></li><li><p> 🌍Recasting <em>Aphelion of Earth</em>&#x27;s spell for <em>Curse of the Forbidden Ones</em> now moves the existing obelisk without resetting sacrifice progress. This is generally useful, but notably also makes it usable on <em>Corrupted Footage</em> charms.</p></li></ul><h2>🫶</h2>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-lights.json b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-lights.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e8dcd65
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-lights.json
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+{
+  "id": "68c1c5a12419bd5909c5fe77",
+  "title": "⚒️Build Contest &amp; Lights",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "valor-shop"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone! We have one more build contest to run before Halloween festivities begin, and a new building mechanic for you to play with. 🔨Build Contest: Forge From magitech constructs to iron forges in deep dwarven mines. 🗓️ Due Date :…",
+  "date": "2025-09-10T13:43:02.194000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey everyone! We have one more build contest to run before Halloween festivities begin, and a new building mechanic for you to play with.</p><h4><strong>🔨Build Contest: Forge</strong></h4><p class=\"post-small\">From magitech constructs to iron forges in deep dwarven mines.</p><ul><li><p>🗓️<strong>Due Date</strong>: Wednesday, September 18th, 2025 11:59 PM PDT</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This event is also listed on the <a href=\"/calendar/\">calendar</a>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Prize Info</strong>: Can be found <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1378477212805763112/1378477212805763112\">here</a>.</p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: Entrants for the top 3 submissions earn <strong>+1 Charms slot</strong> and a free **<strong>Polaris</strong>** relic (see below!)</p></li></ul><h4><strong>💡Lights</strong></h4><p>A new Valor relic, <strong>Polaris</strong>, is available for purchase from Artificer Malachy for <em>1 Nether Star</em> + <em>4 Runes of Sparks</em>.</p><p>Inserting light-emitting blocks or Runes of Sparks into <strong>Polaris</strong> charges it. You can adjust its selected brightness, then &quot;place&quot; it to spawn an invisible light at that brightness, consuming an equivalent amount of charge. There is no cap to the charge, which also allows <strong>Polaris</strong> to act as an infinite sized stack of lights.</p><p>For example, torches give off 14 light, so inserting one adds 14 charge. You can use this to place 1 light of 14 brightness, or 2 lights of 7 brightness, and so on. Looking forward to seeing how you all use this to enhance your builds!</p><h2>🫶</h2>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-updates.json b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-updates.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..df6cad2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-amp-updates.json
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+{
+  "id": "683bbc651fd20c7ba31535c9",
+  "title": "⚒️Build Contest &amp; Updates",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "gameplay",
+    "miscellaneous",
+    "build-contest"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone. Time to start our next build contest and announce a few more general updates! 🪔 Build Contest: Shrine",
+  "date": "2025-05-31T21:42:54.609000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey everyone. Time to start our next build contest and announce a few more general updates!</p><h4>🪔<strong>Build Contest: Shrine</strong></h4><pre><code>A holy place made to worship the divine. Many deities have recently touched our world; what do you worship?</code></pre><ul><li><p>📅<strong>Due Date</strong>: Monday, June 16, 2025 1:59 AM (in your local time)</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This event is also listed on the <a href=\"/calendar/\">calendar</a>, for those interested.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Prize &amp; Submission Info</strong>: See ⁠<a href=\"/changelog-and-faq/build-contest-overview/\">⚒ Build Contest Overview</a></p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: The top 3 entrants will receive +1 Charm slot and a unique charm themed to a Greek deity.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This charm will be released widely in the future, but these winners get first dibs.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4>📝<strong>General Updates</strong></h4><p class=\"post-emphasis\">✏️<strong>Miscellaneous</strong></p><ul><li><p>Fixed standard color codes (such as &amp;9 or &amp;n) not working in text displays.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">Note that text displays also support hex codes, e.g. &lt;#ff0000&gt; for red. This isn&#x27;t new, but stating for visibility.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>You are now auto-equipped with Swift Sneak V leggings in the creative world to help speed bridging while building.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This can be disabled with &#x27;/toggle creative_world swift_sneak&#x27; if desired.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>By popular demand, the Greater Impact mcMMO Axes skill has been disabled.</p></li><li><p>Fixed the Potion Launcher not properly firing lingering potions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\"><strong>📖Runecrafting</strong></p><ul><li><p>Equilibrium and Adrenaline Rush should more reliably catch your health when activated, and are less likely to get you stuck in a pseudo-death state.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Coyote Time should work as desired when sprinting down stairs or over grass/flowers.</p></li><li><p>Disabled ability to activate Rocket Boosting by jumping while ‘/fly’ is enabled as it conflicts too much with toggling flight.</p></li></ul><p>Thanks friends!🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/build-contest-overview.json b/src/content/announcements/build-contest-overview.json
