+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>The results are in!</p><ul><li><p>🥇1st Place: @Starmarsh™ </p></li><li><p>🥈2nd Place: @J_ </p></li><li><p>🥉3rd Place: @Hollow </p></li></ul><p>Congrats to the top 3 and thanks everyone who participated! Come back tomorrow for <em>ANOTHER</em> BYOG PvP tournament with more prizes <strong><em>AND</em></strong> for those of you who don&#x27;t have super decked out gear, we&#x27;re doing a &quot;Gear Provided&quot; PvP tournament after the BYOG! </p><p>Additionally, in order to help streamline the process (and because I just discovered this option😈) <strong>I&#x27;m doing sign-ups for the BYOG tournament tomorrow!</strong></p><p>Sign up for tomorrow&#x27;s BYOG pvp tournament here: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4erFNhu\">https://bit.ly/4erFNhu</a></p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"/assets/news/image-4.png\" alt=\"⚔️Byog PvP Tournament Results · announcement image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          <iframe class=\"post-video\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/L7iIJi5H0Wg\" title=\"Video from ⚔️Byog PvP Tournament Results\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n"
