+{
+  "id": "686c2d4587ea0b7752039c0a",
+  "title": "⬆️Chase the Skies Update &amp; Live Server Map",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "gameplay",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "valor-shop",
+    "miscellaneous"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone, we've got a couple nice updates for you today! 👻Chase the Skies Update - 1.21.7 The server is now live with 1.21.7, the Chase the Skies game drop! This drop primarily includes the Happy Ghast , a new tame Ghast variant that…",
+  "date": "2025-07-07T15:31:32.752000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p class=\"post-emphasis\">Hey everyone, we&#x27;ve got a couple nice updates for you today!</p><h4>👻Chase the Skies Update - 1.21.7</h4><ul><li><p>The server is now live with 1.21.7, the <strong>Chase the Skies</strong> game drop! This drop primarily includes the <em>Happy Ghast</em>, a new tame Ghast variant that you can fly around with friends. See <a href=\"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Chase_the_Skies\">here</a> for more info.</p></li><li><p>We&#x27;ve made Happy Ghasts meaningfully faster than in vanilla. Note that Dried Ghasts can be crafted with 8 Ghast Tears and Soul Sand.</p></li><li><p>Saddles are now craftable, so we no longer buy them in the Server Shop.</p></li><li><p>The two new music discs work with <em>Walkman leggings</em>.</p></li><li><p>We currently have the locator bar enabled. Let us know what you think of it.</p></li></ul><h4>🗺️Live Server Map</h4><ul><li><p>At long last, we&#x27;ve launched an SSS live map! It can be found at <a href=\"/map/\">https://map.sssminecraft.com/</a>. A quick overview of the features:</p></li><li><p>There are maps for <strong>spawn</strong>, the <strong>three survival worlds</strong>, and the <strong>creative world</strong>, which you can swap between in the sidebar.</p></li><li><p>You can see who&#x27;s online in the sidebar, and the map live updates with player positions and world changes.</p></li><li><p>Hovering shows coords in the bottom left, and the controls in the top-left can toggle visibility of players, world borders, and the world spawn.</p></li></ul><h4>📝Other Updates</h4><ul><li><p><em>Aphelion of Earth</em>&#x27;s tendril attacks and Abomination are now treated as magic attacks, letting them synergize with <em>Impetus of Hecate</em>.</p></li><li><p>Vanilla rendering updates allow glows to work with shaders, which importantly means you can see ores sensed with <em>Abyssal Armor</em> with shaders on!</p></li><li><p>When <em>Transmuting</em> to clay, you now get clay balls instead of clay blocks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Thanks friends 🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/contest-reminder-general-updates.json b/src/content/announcements/contest-reminder-general-updates.json
