+{
+  "id": "6875fdd3e668fe63ee339a09",
+  "title": "📚Contest Winners and Clarification",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "miscellaneous",
+    "weekend-rush"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey again everyone. Time to announce the winners of the Greenhouse contest, and one clarification regarding the Parkour Rush. 🪴Greenhouse: Build Contest Winners 🥇 1st Place : @Starmarsh™, @J_, and @໓คriค! Your warp is set as Rafflesia, as…",
+  "date": "2025-07-15T02:08:50.449000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey again everyone. Time to announce the winners of the Greenhouse contest, and one clarification regarding the Parkour Rush.</p><h4><strong>🪴Greenhouse: Build Contest Winners</strong></h4><ul><li><p>🥇<strong>1st Place</strong>: @Starmarsh™, @J_, and @໓คriค! Your warp is set as Rafflesia, as requested.</p></li><li><p>🥈<strong>2nd Place</strong>: @J1mbers, @Krashafa, and @ElectricSparx! I&#x27;ve set your warp as SerraLontana, but LMK if you want it changed!</p></li><li><p>🥉<strong>3rd Place</strong>: A tie!</p><ul><li><p>@Hollow and @jpguitar27! Your warp is set as Eden, as requested.</p></li><li><p>@Maidl, @TroyTheCrafter, and @Shotdown01! Your warp is set as Greenhouse4, though feel free to request a rename!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Thanks so much to the submitters. We&#x27;ve done the prizes a bit differently this time, using voucher items to redeem your silver, Trial points, and/or charm slot. These vouchers are in the reward bundles, which are in your ender chest, or in your inventory if your ender chest is full.</p><h4><strong>‼️Parkour Rush Notice</strong></h4><p>Just wanted to make something clear about the Parkour Rush now that it&#x27;s over - the loot chest reset from the rush is permanent, not just for the rush. If you&#x27;ve already beaten any parkours, you can now go beat them again whenever you feel like it! Only catch is Raceway won&#x27;t give a charm slot again. Apologies that this was unclear.</p><h4>🫶</h4>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/contest-winners-and-general-updates-1.json b/src/content/announcements/contest-winners-and-general-updates-1.json
