+{
+  "id": "693cf2d059580966c279275d",
+  "title": "🎄Holiday Event: 12 Days of Christmas",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "event"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone! Our classic Days of Christmas event is beginning now. This is very similar to previous years, and you can get all of the info by running `/christmas` in-game, but for a quick overview: To start, build your fireplace (a fire…",
+  "date": "2025-12-12T23:02:35.982000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n    \n  \n  <p>Hey everyone! Our classic <em>Days of Christmas</em> event is beginning now. This is very similar to previous years, and you can get all of the info by running `/christmas` in-game, but for a quick overview:</p><ul><li><p>To start, build your <strong>fireplace</strong> (a fire block with at least two adjacent solid blocks) and register it with `/christmas fireplace`.</p></li><li><p>A present spawns near your fireplace upon your first daily login starting <strong>December 14th</strong>. The date is checked in Eastern Time for this event.</p></li><li><p>There are <strong>12 presents</strong>, though the event runs for through December 31st, so there&#x27;s plenty of leeway if you miss a day.</p></li><li><p>Many presents are quite valuable, and some are unique to the event. Everyone gets the same presents in the same order.</p></li></ul><p>Happy holidays to you all! 🎅</p><h4>🏭Contest Reminder</h4><p>Reminder that <strong>Factory</strong> build contest entries are due in just over 3 hours. It&#x27;s better to submit it unfinished than not at all!</p><p>🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
