+{
+  "id": "69acb115c1ebf87e24f26743",
+  "title": "🐔Mounts of Mayhem Expansion Launch",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "event",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "valor-shop"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone! The Rune Rush, new relics, and enchant updates for the Mounts of Mayhem Expansion are all now live. Final quick overview of the changes and timeline! Tier VI surges , each starting the research for a new spear enchant, will…",
+  "date": "2026-03-07T17:18:36.408000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey everyone! The Rune Rush, new relics, and enchant updates for the Mounts of Mayhem Expansion are all now live.</p><p>Final quick overview of the changes and timeline!</p><ul><li><p><strong>🕰️Tier VI surges</strong>, each starting the research for a new spear enchant, will occur at (in PST): </p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 7, 2026 10 AM </p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 7, 2026 3 PM </p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 7, 2026 8 PM</p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 8, 2026 10 AM</p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 8, 2026 3 PM</p></li><li><p class=\"post-small\">March 8, 2026 8 PM</p><ul><li><p>We expect the enchants to be found not <em>too</em> long after their surge is beaten, so be online if you want to witness the discovery. This won&#x27;t be a multi-day discovery process like during the OG event!</p></li></ul></li><li><p>💎The <strong>Valor Shop</strong> contains the new relics <strong>Messina</strong>, a trident-spear hybrid, and <strong>G.A.M.M.A.</strong>, a spear relic which can gather Primordial Dust.</p></li><li><p>📖The <strong>Paradigms</strong> Wrath and Vainglory have been reworked, and Lust has been buffed.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/changelog-and-faq/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes/\">The FAQ post</a> has been updated with the full, final descriptions of the new relics and reworked enchants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Hope to see you all online soon for the first event surge! 🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.json b/src/content/announcements/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f2476b6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.json
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+{
+  "id": "69a4a9395d7b8a16f464e52f",
+  "title": "📝Mounts of Mayhem Expansion patch notes",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "runecrafting",
+    "valor-shop",
+    "event",
+    "faq"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "🪄 Runic Shift Event ⏫A Rune Rush will replace the March 7th - 8th Ominous Rush. This grants +25% rune drops and causes fully failed Runecrafts to return 3 runes. 🕰️Six Tier VI surges will run automatically at the following times(PDT):…",
+  "date": "2026-03-01T15:17:59.404000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <h4>🪄Runic Shift Event</h4><ul><li><p>⏫A <strong>Rune Rush</strong> will replace the March 7th - 8th Ominous Rush. This grants +25% rune drops and causes fully failed Runecrafts to return 3 runes.</p></li><li><p><strong>🕰️Six Tier VI</strong> surges will run automatically at the following times(PDT): </p><ul><li><p>March 7, 2026 10:00 AM </p></li><li><p>March 7, 2026 3:00 PM</p></li><li><p>March 7, 2026 8:00 PM </p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 10:00 AM </p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 3:00 PM</p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 8:00 AM</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🪛Defeated Tier VI apexes drop an <em>Attuned Boundary Fragment</em> which uncovers the research project of a <strong>new spear enchantment</strong> once given to the Arcanum.</p></li><li><p>💎Defeated Tier V apexes drop a standard <em>Boundary Fragment</em> which can be submitted for 50% research project progress.</p></li><li><p>📜The research quest for these projects will reroll immediately upon completion.</p></li></ul><h4>🛡️Valor Shop: Spear Relics</h4><ul><li><p>🦑<strong>Messina</strong>, a new <em>hybrid</em> which starts as the trident <em>Charybdis</em>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>🪛Charybdis</strong> has the mythical trajectory enchant <em>Whirlpool</em>🌟. It leaves <em>Scylla</em> behind in-hand when thrown.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Whirlpool🌟</strong>: Throws fly straight and pull enemies, then slam down and form a suffocating whirlpool.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>🪛Scylla</strong> is a diamond spear with no minimum attack range and with the mythical dash enchant <em>Man-Eater</em>🌟. <em>Charybdis</em> can be collected, replacing Scylla, once no enemies are in its whirlpool.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Man-Eater🌟</strong>: Charges forcibly dash to Charybdis, briefly liquefying terrain. Jabs near the whirlpool pull in enemies and execute at 10% HP, sating 1 hunger.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p>☢️<strong>G.A.M.M.A.</strong>, a diamond spear with the mythical loot enchant <em>Cyclotron 🌟</em>. While moving very fast, drops are atomized, often converting to a Primordial Dust.</p></li></ul><h4>📖Runecrafting: Paradigm Updates</h4><ul><li><p>❤️‍🔥<strong>Paradigm of Lust</strong>: (Buff) Scorn leap range strongly increased. Attacking scorned targets heals your defended ally.</p></li><li><p><strong>🤬Paradigm of Wrath</strong>: (Rework) Your swing becomes a rapid <em>onslaught</em> using all melee hotbar weapons, <em>but</em> your hotbar must <em>all</em> be melee weapons for strikes to land.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">Onslaught attacks have 2x speed and ignore mercy frames.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🪞<strong>Paradigm of Vainglory</strong>: (Rework) Your swings fire as piercing waves, and you can hover at full health, but you strike yourself, bypassing armor, when your waves miss.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">Hover: Swing directly up to toggle the hover. It disables once you witness your health fall below full.</p></li></ul></li></ul>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion.json b/src/content/announcements/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion.json
