+{
+  "id": "69571b15e3f4a2134e223fcd",
+  "title": "🏇Mounts of Mayhem Update - 1.21.11",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "gameplay",
+    "runecrafting"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone. The server is now live with 1.21.11, the Mounts of Mayhem game drop! This drop adds spears, a new primary tiered weapon whose damage scales with velocity, and some new mounts, such as the Nautilus. See here for more info.…",
+  "date": "2026-01-01T19:18:09.858000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n    \n  \n  <p>Hey everyone. The server is now live with 1.21.11, the <strong>Mounts of Mayhem</strong> game drop! This drop adds spears, a new primary tiered weapon whose damage scales with velocity, and some new mounts, such as the Nautilus. See <a href=\"https://(https://minecraft.wiki/w/Mounts_of_Mayhem)\">here</a> for more info.</p><p>We&#x27;ve got a few supporting updates for SSS systems:</p><ul><li><p>💀<strong>Mob heads</strong> are available for the Parched, Camel Husks, and all 3 Nautilus variants.</p></li><li><p>🥚<strong>Mob catching</strong> works for Camel Husks and all 3 Nautilus variants, as well as for any pacified mob, such as <em>Shrink Ray</em> victims.</p></li><li><p>🏒<strong>Spears</strong> can be enchanted with <em>Extinction</em>, all <em>Aspects</em>, <em>Bounty Hunter</em>, <em>Soulbound</em>, <em>Unbreaking IV</em>, and weaponry curses like <em>Bloodletting</em>.</p></li><li><p>⚽<strong>Maces</strong> can now be enchanted with <em>Bounty Hunter</em>.</p></li><li><p>💾`/lexicon by_item` allows searching by `spears` and also now by `shovels`, which was missing previously.</p></li><li><p>💾 `/valor` has improved click-based navigation in its interfaces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Let us know if you run into any issues. Cheers and Happy New Year! 🫶 🎇</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/pvp-events-amp-paragons.json b/src/content/announcements/pvp-events-amp-paragons.json
