@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+{
+  "id": "685d01e313f8b83809e9a1d0",
+  "title": "⚔️PvP Events &amp; Paragons",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "event",
+    "gameplay",
+    "valor-shop"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey again everyone! Here to notify you about more PvP tournaments this weekend and some general updates from the past week or so. 🤺BYOG PvP Events @MrJoned will be holding more bring your own gear PvP events each day this weekend. These…",
+  "date": "2025-06-26T03:23:01.881000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p class=\"post-emphasis\">Hey again everyone! Here to notify you about more PvP tournaments this weekend and some general updates from the past week or so.</p><h4>🤺BYOG PvP Events</h4><p>@MrJoned will be holding more bring your own gear PvP events each day this weekend. These events times are visible on our calendar. This will include another 1v1 bracket tournament and some misc events like free-for-all fights.</p><p><strong>If you want to participate in the 1v1 bracket tournament, please reach out to Jon in advance.</strong> This isn&#x27;t required, but it will help him prepare the brackets in advance and schedule the matchups.</p><ul><li><p>📅<strong>Event Dates</strong>: Saturday, June 28, 2025 11:00 AM PDT and Sunday, June 29, 2025 11:00 AM PDT</p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Prizes</strong>: Badges of Valor and a free copy of the <strong>Sanguine Phial</strong> charm.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This is the charm awarded to the recent build contest winners and which will become generally available soon.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><p><strong>⚔️PvP Balance</strong></p><ul><li><p>The Film Reel charm no longer reduces spell cooldowns in PvP arenas.,</p></li><li><p>The Aegis runic tome spell now has a 10 second cooldown and lasts 5 seconds in PvP arenas.,</p></li></ul><p><strong>✏️Miscellaneous</strong></p><ul><li><p>The mcMMO archery, mace, and trident skills now grant far more experience.,</p></li><li><p>Weather no longer resets from sleeping.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This was changed during the River Rush, but is a general change we&#x27;re testing. Let us know what you think of it.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>The sell price of tropical fish has been increased dramatically (from 200 silver to 2000), but ones dropped by slain tropical fish are no longer sellable.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This is intended to buff tropical fish earned via fishing to the appropriate value relative to their rarity.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><em>All</em> Valor quests will now have a 4-hour cooldown during rushes rather than just A Vexing Situation.,</p></li><li><p>The Moments spell of the Runic Tome is now quieter and ages up animals faster.,</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Looking forward to seeing everyone online for the Lucky Rush this weekend 🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
