+  "date": "2025-06-29T21:29:11.746000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>The results are in! For the BYOG Tournament:</p><ul><li><p>🥇1st Place: @Starmarsh™ </p></li><li><p>🥈2nd Place: @J_ </p></li><li><p>🥉3rd Place: @nate </p></li></ul><p>For the Provided Gear Tournament:</p><ul><li><p>🥇1st Place: @ElectricSparx </p></li><li><p>🥈2nd Place: @J_ </p></li><li><p>🥉3rd Place: @Starmarsh™ </p></li></ul><p>Congrats to our top 6 and thanks @everyone who participated! Video should be up later today. I&#x27;ll probably give you guys a break from PVP for a bit (and for some balance changes to go through), but I&#x27;m excited for the next one, whenever it is. Look forward to more BYOG and Provided Gear tournaments in the future, hope to see you all there next time </p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"/assets/news/image-2.png\" alt=\"⚔️PvP Tournaments Results · announcement image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"/assets/news/image-3.png\" alt=\"⚔️PvP Tournaments Results · announcement image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          <iframe class=\"post-video\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/MLLazWzZXlQ\" title=\"Video from ⚔️PvP Tournaments Results\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          <iframe class=\"post-video\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/V_WEZm2XIBA\" title=\"Video from ⚔️PvP Tournaments Results\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n"
