diff --git a/src/content/announcements/runecrafting-expansion-wrap-up.json b/src/content/announcements/runecrafting-expansion-wrap-up.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..20b54c5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/runecrafting-expansion-wrap-up.json
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+{
+  "id": "68473d71c08d366d2f902106",
+  "title": "📖Runecrafting Expansion Wrap Up",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "runecrafting",
+    "miscellaneous",
+    "valor-shop"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "With the discovery of Walkman, the final Runecrafting expansion is complete! Thank you all so, so much for your engagement and enthusiasm with not only this event, but truly the entire content update; we couldn’t be happier with the…",
+  "date": "2025-06-09T15:07:19.721000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p class=\"post-emphasis\">With the discovery of <strong>Walkman</strong>, the final Runecrafting expansion is complete!</p><p>Thank you all so, so much for your engagement and enthusiasm with not only this event, but truly the entire content update; we couldn’t be happier with the response! We&#x27;d like to wrap with a final special Runecrafting announcement, then a quick look at what’s next. </p><h4><strong>🏅Special Thanks</strong></h4><p>First, as thanks for everyone’s efforts, all researchers will soon receive an ancestral <strong>Boundary Fragment</strong> commemorating your contributions!</p><p>We also extend particular thanks to <strong>four key researchers</strong> who showcased great interest and theorizing. Each will soon receive a unique, ancestral Mythic Rune from the college archives. These runes are relics of other times, now inert and only found in mythical enchants and legends. They are novelties which we hope you will cherish - and thanks to each of you for your outsized contribution to making events like this worthwhile!</p><ul><li><p>❤️@J_, for your ingenuity and discernment of all possibilities, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Prisms</strong>. May it aid your search for other realms.</p></li><li><p>💎@Starmarsh™, for your valor and lasting guidance, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Whispers</strong>. May their voices guide you.</p></li><li><p>📈@TroyTheCrafter, for your great ambition, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Asymptotes</strong>. May it lead you ever upwards.</p></li><li><p>🏅@Maidl, for your prolific longevity, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Silence</strong>. May you be inspired by the persistence of what has always been.</p></li><li><p>🏆As each expansion&#x27;s top discoverer, @J_ and @Starmarsh™ are also granted the <strong>Rune of Singularities</strong>. May it pull you to further greatness.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>📆What&#x27;s Next?</strong></h4><p>The expansion was our big map event, but we have more in the works! No exact timelines yet, but here are some things to look forward to in the coming weeks:</p><ul><li><p>✏️A post from the design team covering how we concepted this expansion, and more Valor lore stories.</p></li><li><p>🔋The return of <strong>runic surges</strong> in a new form.</p></li><li><p>📿A <strong>Charms</strong> drop containing roughly 10 new charms to experiment with.</p></li><li><p>⬆️Rotating <strong>rush weekends</strong> which will give free boosts in various areas. These will happen every weekend!</p></li><li><p>⛏️QoL updates for builders, including updates to ‘/display’ and access to light blocks.</p></li><li><p>⚔️A new <strong>duo BYOG Trial</strong> with unique prizes.</p></li><li><p>⚒️Continued contests and events as long as there is interest!</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Thanks again everyone. We love you and couldn&#x27;t do this without the encouragement we get from your enjoyment. It means the world!</p><p class=\"post-emphasis\">-🫶Staff</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/rush-weekends-amp-general-updates.json b/src/content/announcements/rush-weekends-amp-general-updates.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..47e9209
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/content/announcements/rush-weekends-amp-general-updates.json
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+{
+  "id": "6854efa546c80a157ff70571",
+  "title": "⏫Rush Weekends &amp; General Updates",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "gameplay",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "miscellaneous",
+    "event",
+    "weekend-rush"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Greetings everyone! It’s time to formally announce our Rush Weekends and give a few fun general updates! Rush Weekends Rush Weekends are a new permanent feature of Silver Springs. They run every weekend for the full 24 hours of Saturday…",
+  "date": "2025-06-20T00:33:06.484000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p class=\"post-emphasis\">Greetings everyone! It’s time to formally announce our <em>Rush Weekends</em> and give a few fun general updates!</p><h4>Rush Weekends</h4><p>Rush Weekends are a new permanent feature of Silver Springs. They run every weekend for the full 24 hours of Saturday and Sunday, in Pacific time. The first will begin <strong>this Saturday, June 21st.</strong></p><p>Each rush activates a set of shared <strong>Core Bonuses</strong> to help you enjoy the weekend, as well as a random <strong>Wild Bonus</strong> from a list. Below are the <strong>Core Bonuses</strong> of each rush (every weekend!), as well as the <strong>Wild Bonus</strong> for the first rush this weekend - the <strong>River Rush</strong>!</p><p class=\"post-emphasis\"><strong>✅Core Bonuses</strong></p><ul><li><p>+25% to earned Trial Points, mcMMO XP, and Boardwalk tickets, and to rune drop rates</p></li><li><p>The quest <strong>A Vexing Situation</strong> has only a 4-hour cooldown</p></li><li><p>mcMMO diminishing returns cap at 0.5x XP instead of 0.25x</p></li></ul><p class=\"post-emphasis\"><strong>🐟Wild Bonus - River Rush!</strong></p><ul><li><p>It’s not SSS without rain and community fishing! During this rush, rain lasts longer and you’ll hook fish a bit quicker.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>General Updates</strong></h4><p><strong>🧍Armor stands</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Updated the Armor Stand Customizer which is accessed by sneak right clicking armor stands:</p><ul><li><p>The smallness toggle has been replaced with +/- buttons to modify the armor stand&#x27;s scale between 0.2x and 2x.</p></li><li><p>Added a &quot;Swap Armor&quot; button to swap all armor the armor stand is wearing with your own.</p></li><li><p>Added a lower interface with editable slots to control equipment. This lets you put anything in their slots, including the hand slots for ones with arms.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Added ‘/rotate info’, which allows punching an armor stand to view all of its current rotations.</p></li></ul><p><strong>📖Runecrafting balance</strong>, largely in preparation for the PvP tournament this weekend:</p><ul><li><p>Reduced the PvP damage of the <em>Avatar of Wardens</em> sonic blast from 5 ❤ to 1.5 ❤.</p></li><li><p>Reduced the damage of <em>Gatling</em>&#x27;s additional arrows by 50%.</p><ul><li><p class=\"post-small\">This is harsh, but we believe justified. It too quickly outscales options like <em>Multishot</em>, and some of its power comes from the sheer projectile count, which increases reliability and proc rates, so it doesn&#x27;t need best-in-class damage within a few shots. It still scales into being the strongest DPS spread enchant.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Halved the duration of <em>Adrenaline Rush</em>&#x27;s reduced speed and gravity in PvP.</p></li><li><p>Fixed <em>Ice Aspect</em> and <em>Plague Aspect</em> applying their effects even when the hit was blocked.</p></li></ul><p>✏️For those who were interested in the design behind the Arcanum expansion, a large post detailing the process is available here: <a href=\"/changelog-and-faq/designing-boundaries-of-the-arcanum/\">Designing Boundaries of the Arcanum</a></p><p>✨Added the ‘/paragon’ command for viewing info about the existing Paragon items.</p><p>🪲Fixed mcMMO XP diminishing returns going down to 0.05x instead of our intended 0.25x. mcMMO was bugged and ignoring our config for this field.</p><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Thanks, friends! Please leave feedback for any of this in ⁠#💌feedback-and-suggestions as usual. 🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"/assets/news/image-5.png\" alt=\"⏫Rush Weekends &amp;amp; General Updates · announcement image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n"
+}
