+{
+  "id": "68eabfd95cbe1d631e8dbd2c",
+  "title": "🍄Spooky Springs 2025",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Spooky Springs is a communal build contest run during the Halloween season: 📖 Overview : The event takes place in a gloomy mushroom cave at `/warp SpookySprings`. The cave contains 20 plots. Approach one and right click the sign on its…",
+  "date": "2025-10-11T15:45:02.580000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n    \n  \n  <p>Spooky Springs is a communal build contest run during the Halloween season:</p><h4>📖<strong>Overview</strong>:</h4><ul><li><p>The event takes place in a <em>gloomy mushroom cave</em> at `/warp SpookySprings`.</p></li><li><p>The cave contains 20 plots. Approach one and right click the sign on its front wall to claim it for free. You can only claim one plot.</p></li><li><p>Plots are 17x61x17, extending 30 blocks up and down. Your entire contest entry must be contained within this space.</p></li><li><p>If you want to build with a friend, stand in your plot and use `/as addfriend &lt;name&gt;` to give them permission to build there.</p></li><li><p>You all then help decide the winners! After the build period, you&#x27;ll have 2 days to vote for your top 3 plots. You can&#x27;t vote for your own.</p><ul><li><p>Details on how to vote will be sent once the build phase ends.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4>📝Details:</h4><ul><li><p>🎃<strong>Theme</strong>: Halloween. That&#x27;s it - anything seasonal, spooky, or scary is valid!</p></li><li><p>🗓️<strong>Due Date</strong>: Wednesday, October 29, 2025 11:59 PM PDT (Also listed on the <a href=\"/calendar/\">calendar</a>)</p></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Standard Info</strong>: Can be found <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1378477212805763112\">here</a> on discord or <a href=\"/changelog-and-faq/build-contest-overview/\">here</a> on the website.</p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: Entrants for the top 3 submissions earn <strong>+1 Charms slot</strong> and a ton of Halloween candy.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-reminder-amp-update.json b/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-reminder-amp-update.json
