+{
+  "id": "68f44ab3a8b72d37217e4aba",
+  "title": "🎃Spooky Springs Reminder &amp; Update",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "gameplay",
+    "runecrafting"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone. Here to give a quick reminder and update on Spooky Springs and a few general updates. 🍄‍🟫Spooky Springs Reminder that there's still about 12 days for Spooky Springs, which is plenty of time to make a build. A number of plots…",
+  "date": "2025-10-18T21:23:26.376000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p class=\"post-emphasis\">Hey everyone. Here to give a quick reminder and update on Spooky Springs and a few general updates.</p><h4>🍄‍🟫Spooky Springs</h4><ul><li><p>Reminder that there&#x27;s still about 12 days for Spooky Springs, which is plenty of time to make a build. A number of plots are still open!</p></li><li><p>We&#x27;ve also decided to add some prizes. These are in addition to the standard and special prizes already announced:</p><ul><li><p>🎃The top 3 builds will earn the <strong>Pumpkin Mask</strong> charm, which grants -20% detection range and stops Endermen from angering at your sight.</p></li><li><p>🍬ALL entrants will receive the <strong>Treat Bag</strong> charm, which allows mobs to sometimes drop Halloween treats even outside of the season.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>We recently doubled the build contest entry prize to 50k silver and 4 Badges of Valor. A simple Spooky Springs build gets you both of those <em>and</em> a Treat Bag!</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🤖The Moments runic spell now progresses Copper Golem oxidization. It takes <em>many</em> casts to fully oxidize them, but it&#x27;s far faster than the hours it takes otherwise.</p></li><li><p>🧙 Fixed some <em>Pointy Hat</em> trades not giving the correct number of potions.</p></li><li><p>🐈‍⬛ Fixed some special Halloween spawns appearing in unexpected areas.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-voting-general-updates.json b/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-voting-general-updates.json
