@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+{
+  "id": "6904ec117f99a6601e6bbc34",
+  "title": "🎃Spooky Springs Voting, General Updates",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest",
+    "gameplay",
+    "runecrafting",
+    "miscellaneous"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "🍄‍🟫 Spooky Springs Voting Now that the build phase is complete, you can go vote for your top 3 Spooky Springs plots. To vote, stand in a plot and use `/halloween vote <1st, 2nd, or 3rd>`. Tab completion is available. You can change your…",
+  "date": "2025-10-31T12:11:49.567000-05:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n    \n  \n  <h4>🍄‍🟫<strong>Spooky Springs Voting</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Now that the build phase is complete, you can go <strong>vote</strong> for your top 3 Spooky Springs plots.</p></li><li><p>To vote, stand in a plot and use `/halloween vote &lt;1st, 2nd, or 3rd&gt;`. Tab completion is available.</p></li><li><p>You can change your votes freely by re-casting them, and you don&#x27;t need to vote for all 3 placements. You can&#x27;t vote for your own plot.</p></li><li><p>Thanks to all who have entered!</p></li></ul><h4>📝<strong>General Updates</strong></h4><ul><li><p>💡Added `/creative_world light_wand`, which can be used in the creative world to spawn an infinite stack Polaris.</p></li><li><p>🖼️Paintings can once again be changed in a stonecutter.</p></li><li><p>👮Copper bars and chains can once again be scraped with an axe to unwax or deoxidize them.</p></li><li><p>🏹 <em>Whispering</em> once again does its bonus damage on overcharged shots.</p></li></ul><h4>❤️Personal Note</h4><p>Apologies for the above bugs - on a personal note, Bec and I got married last Thursday, the 23rd, so we&#x27;ve been a bit busy as you can imagine!! Thanks for the various congrats and well wishes from those who have already heard. ☺️ </p><p class=\"post-emphasis\">Much love everyone 🫶</p>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
diff --git a/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-winners.json b/src/content/announcements/spooky-springs-winners.json
