+{
+  "id": "6911438210afed2991e2e060",
+  "title": "🎃Spooky Springs Winners",
+  "author": "Jonathan Hill",
+  "topics": [
+    "build-contest"
+  ],
+  "excerpt": "Hey everyone, here to announce the winners of Spooky Springs. 🥇 1st Place : A tie! @JoshRallus and @SojuBurns! @Nate! 🥉 3rd Place : @J1mbers! Thanks everyone for voting and congrats to the top 3! You'll find two bundles in your ender…",
+  "date": "2025-11-09T19:47:00.613000-06:00",
+  "draft": false,
+  "body": "\n  \n  <p>Hey everyone, here to announce the winners of Spooky Springs.</p><ul><li><p>🥇 <strong>1st Place</strong>: A tie!</p><ul><li><p>@JoshRallus and @SojuBurns!</p></li><li><p>@Nate!</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🥉 <strong>3rd Place</strong>: @J1mbers!</p></li></ul><p>Thanks everyone for voting and congrats to the top 3! You&#x27;ll find two bundles in your ender chests - one with the standard prizes and two charms (<em>Treat Bag</em> and <em>Pumpkin Mask</em>), and another containing a stack of Halloween treats. All other entrants should have one bundle with the standard prizes and a <em>Treat Bag</em>. If it didn&#x27;t fit in your ender chest, it&#x27;s in your inventory instead.</p><h4>🫶</h4>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
+}
