+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,15 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-  <p class="post-emphasis">Hey everyone. The server is (finally!) updated to 26.2, which covers the Chaos Cubed and Tiny Takeover game drops.</p><ul><li><p><strong>🧊Chaos Cubed</strong> adds a new sulfur cave biome and their sulfur cube inhabitants who can be fed certain blocks to become different physics objects.</p></li><li><p><strong>🐥Tiny Takeover</strong> remodels all baby animals, makes name tags craftable, and adds the golden dandelion, which can keep mobs as babies forever!</p></li></ul><p>SSS has the following supporting and miscellaneous updates:</p><ul><li><p>🌎The resource world has been regenerated. Go find some sulfur caves!</p></li><li><p>🧊Sulfur cubes of the smallest size can drop a Sulfur Cube Head.</p></li><li><p>🎶The new Bounce music disc is playable in Walkman.</p></li><li><p>🏷️The server shop no longer buys name tags, as they are cheaply craftable.</p></li><li><p>😁Happy Ghasts you&#x27;ve protected (such as by naming them) can now be used with Impetus of Artemis.</p></li><li><p>💍Added /charm info to view info about a charm. This covers all charms, not just the Valor Shop ones.</p></li><li><p>🥔Poisonous potatoes can no longer be given to babies to prevent their growth. Use the golden dandelion!</p></li></ul><p>There were a ton of technical changes to the game behind the scenes for these updates, which contributed to the delays and required a number of updates from me to stabilize. If you notice anything behaving oddly (especially particles or in-game text from commands), please let me know.</p><p>Cheers! </p>
