-  <p>Hey @everyone. Time to announce the winners of the Tavern build contest!</p><ul><li><p>🥇<strong>1st Place</strong>: @NetworkGremlin and @gabreno! Your warp is set as `Tavern1`.</p></li><li><p>🥈 <strong>2nd Place</strong>: @J_, @Starmarsh, and @Daria! Your warp is set as `Mycobarrow`.</p></li><li><p>🥉 <strong>3rd Place</strong>: A tie!</p><ul><li><p>@J1mbers! Your warp is set as `DeadEnd`.</p></li><li><p>@Cubic and @nate! Your warp is set as `JourneysEnd`.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Thanks so much to all who submitted. Your prize bundles are in your ender chests, and lemme know if you want your warps renamed!</p><h2>🫶</h2>
