-  <p>Blood Moons are a special event that can activate during the Halloween season on Silver Springs.</p><ul><li><p>🌕When a full moon rises in the survival or resource world, a <strong>Blood Moon</strong> activates - a sleepless night of dangerous foes.</p></li><li><p>🌑Enemies which spawn under the light of the Blood Moon are stronger and drop better loot:</p><ul><li><p>🩻Wither Skeletons with fiery bows and Zombified Piglins spawn in the overworld throughout the night.</p></li><li><p>💪These enemies, and all others, are bigger, stronger, and faster. Creepers explode in a wider radius, leaving behind enfeebling clouds.</p></li><li><p>🦾Empowered enemies drop additional XP, uncommonly an <strong>occult item </strong>(same pool as <em>Dowsing Thumb</em>), and rarely the <strong>Sanguine Phial</strong> charm.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🩸The <strong>Sanguine Phial</strong> stacks at double rate for kills during Blood Moons.</p></li></ul>
