-  <p>Hey again @everyone. Time for a new build contest and a few quick general updates.</p><h4>🏭Build Contest: Factory</h4><pre><code>From deeply industrial to steampunk to magic and more!</code></pre><ul><li><p>🗓️<strong>Due Date</strong>: Friday, December 12, 2025 11:59 PM PST. This is ~4 days longer than normal to account for Thanksgiving for those celebrating.</p><ul><li><p>This event is also listed on the <a href="/calendar/">calendar</a>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Prize Info</strong>: Can be found <a href="https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1378477212805763112/1378477212805763112">here</a>.</p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: Entrants for the top 3 submissions earn <strong>+1 Charms slot</strong> and <strong>5 Wind-up Keys</strong> from the Valor Gift Shop.</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🐺<em>Cerberus</em> now displays its loading phase progress on the action bar while it&#x27;s held in either form.</p></li><li><p>🤖Copper Golems are now automatically protected by whoever spawned them. This works retroactively.</p></li><li><p>💛<em>Curse of Bloodletting</em> now consumes Absorption hearts first if you have any.</p></li><li><p>🎄Early FYI that we&#x27;ll run our typical 12 Days of Christmas gift event next month. Fireplace registration will open closer to the event, though of course feel free to prep them now if you&#x27;d like!</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis">🫶 Happy to see a decent number of you still hopping on this deep into the map. Much love!</p>
