-  <p>Hey everyone. Time to start our next build contest and announce a few more general updates!</p><h4>🪔<strong>Build Contest: Shrine</strong></h4><pre><code>A holy place made to worship the divine. Many deities have recently touched our world; what do you worship?</code></pre><ul><li><p>📅<strong>Due Date</strong>: Monday, June 16, 2025 1:59 AM (in your local time)</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">This event is also listed on the <a href="/calendar/">calendar</a>, for those interested.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>✏️<strong>Prize &amp; Submission Info</strong>: See ⁠<a href="/changelog-and-faq/build-contest-overview/">⚒ Build Contest Overview</a></p></li><li><p>🏆<strong>Special Prize</strong>: The top 3 entrants will receive +1 Charm slot and a unique charm themed to a Greek deity.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">This charm will be released widely in the future, but these winners get first dibs.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4>📝<strong>General Updates</strong></h4><p class="post-emphasis">✏️<strong>Miscellaneous</strong></p><ul><li><p>Fixed standard color codes (such as &amp;9 or &amp;n) not working in text displays.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Note that text displays also support hex codes, e.g. &lt;#ff0000&gt; for red. This isn&#x27;t new, but stating for visibility.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>You are now auto-equipped with Swift Sneak V leggings in the creative world to help speed bridging while building.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">This can be disabled with &#x27;/toggle creative_world swift_sneak&#x27; if desired.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>By popular demand, the Greater Impact mcMMO Axes skill has been disabled.</p></li><li><p>Fixed the Potion Launcher not properly firing lingering potions.</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>📖Runecrafting</strong></p><ul><li><p>Equilibrium and Adrenaline Rush should more reliably catch your health when activated, and are less likely to get you stuck in a pseudo-death state.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Coyote Time should work as desired when sprinting down stairs or over grass/flowers.</p></li><li><p>Disabled ability to activate Rocket Boosting by jumping while ‘/fly’ is enabled as it conflicts too much with toggling flight.</p></li></ul><p>Thanks friends!🫶</p>
