-  
-  <p>Hey everyone - big weekend ahead! Aside from the PvP events, there&#x27;s new charms, the Lucky Rush, and general updates with an upcoming build contest FYI.</p><h4>📿Charms</h4><p>There are <strong>12 new charms</strong> to find:</p><ul><li><p>💎The <strong>Valor Shop</strong> has 5 new charms. They are listed in-game in ‘/valor charms’, but a few examples:</p><ul><li><p><strong>🗿Bobblehead</strong>: Gain the Luck effect permanently while wearing your own head.</p></li><li><p><strong>💧Prince Rupert&#x27;s Drop</strong>: Your hazard enchants activate with massive power when struck from behind.</p></li><li><p><strong>🗝️Spare Key</strong>: Your first charm slot can be modified even while your charms case is locked.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>💀The <strong>Crypt Trial Shop</strong> sells the <strong>Metal Detector</strong>, which extracts scrap in place of junk when brushing suspicious sediments.</p></li><li><p>🎈The <strong>Boardwalk</strong> sells <strong>Balloon Animal</strong>, which causes allied mobs to pop on death, applying a radial stun and damage. Tragic!</p></li><li><p>There are <strong>5 other charms</strong> findable either <em>around spawn</em> or <em>via gameplay</em>, including the <strong>Sanguine Phial</strong>. Keep an eye out!</p></li></ul><p>Some old charms have also been updated:</p><ul><li><p><strong>🍵Coffee Beans</strong>: Reworked! Gain speed, haste, and double experience during sunrise.</p></li><li><p><strong>🏌️Golf Club</strong>: Reworked! Your attacks gain range, ignore some mob knockback resist, and deal double knockback to small targets.</p></li><li><p><strong>🔻Nerfs</strong>: Reduced Adventurer&#x27;s Tricorne boss payout to 250 silver. Made Hourglass Sands only work on utility items. Reduced Runic Compass proc rate.</p></li></ul><h4>✨Lucky Rush</h4><p>The rush starts in just a few! In addition to the <a href="/changelog-and-faq/rush-weekends/">Core Bonuses</a>, this rush has two main benefits:</p><ul><li><p><strong>+3 Luck</strong> all weekend. Simple but effective - and good for hunting for charms!,</p></li><li><p><strong>Lucky Events</strong> can randomly activate to amplify certain events. Keep an eye out!,</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>⚒️FYI, we&#x27;ll announce a new build contest Sunday night PST which awards a Charm slot. We&#x27;re delaying the start to avoid distracting from weekend events.</p></li><li><p>🔨<strong>Impetus of Hephaestus</strong> gem stats decay when striking with a non-artisan weapon, and Luck caps at 8 stacks.</p></li><li><p>⚡<strong>Impetus of Zeus</strong> grants charge from landing shots, has improved slow down physics, and slows you while aiming a spyglass.</p></li><li><p>☁️<strong>Terados</strong>&#x27;s maps have waypoints for <em>A Vexing Situation</em>&#x27;s quest locations, and a subtle leaf trail guides the path between them, to aid players new to the quest.</p></li><li><p>🐶More <strong>allied mobs</strong> grant mcMMO taming XP and benefit from taming passives. This ignores most humanoid allies, like <em>Paradigm of Greed</em> contractors, but works for an <em>Avatar of Phantoms</em> horde, for example.</p></li></ul>
-
