-  <p>Hey again everyone. It&#x27;s been an exciting few days - we&#x27;ve jumped from 8 discoveries to 19 in the few days since our last announcement! There are over 50 enchants total, so still tons to find, but great work so far! It&#x27;s time to announce the build contest winners, and give a few more days’ worth of general updates.</p><h4>🔭<strong>Observatory: Build Contest Winners</strong></h4><p>Thanks much to all the entrants, these were really fun to judge! Here are the top 3 entries:</p><ul><li><p>🥇<strong>1st Place</strong>: J1mbers and Krashafa - A perfect score from all judges! Your warp is set as Observatory1.</p></li><li><p>🥈<strong>2nd Place</strong>: Starmarsh and Daria! Your warp is set as Oculus as requested.</p></li><li><p>🥉<strong>3rd Place</strong>: A tie!</p><ul><li><p>Maidl and TroyTheCrafter! Your warp is set as Observatory3.,</p></li><li><p>TheJ_Team! Your warp is set as Observatory4.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Congrats winners! For all entrants, your prize money has been distributed (split evenly where necessary) and your prize items are in a bundle on the bottom row of the submitter&#x27;s ender chest (J1mbers, Star, and Maidl for the joint entries). Winners, feel free to request a free warp rename if desired.</p><h4>📝<strong>General Updates</strong></h4><ul><li><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>💎Socketing</strong></p><ul><li><p>Gem socketing now works for custom helmets!</p></li><li><p>Note that Runecrafted enchants can be applied to custom helmets. This isn&#x27;t new, but stating it for visibility.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class="post-emphasis">🪙<strong>Shops</strong></p><ul><li><p>Updated the stock and price of items sold at ‘/warp buyables’. Notably, we now sell Creaking Spawn Eggs, Gilded Blackstone, and Reinforced Deepslate.</p></li><li><p>You can sneak + punch to bulk sell to the server shop. This was changed a little while back, but listing it for visibility.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>📖Runecrafting Event</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>The enchant research quest board now displays % progress of ongoing projects, and a board has been added for new discoveries from this expansion.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>✏️Miscellaneous</strong></p><ul><li><p>Fixed potions brewing directly to their extended state and sometimes not granting mcMMO Alchemy XP.</p></li><li><p>You can now cleanse candles in a cauldron to undye them.</p></li><li><p>Added a toggle in /toggle sounds to disable the sound that plays every jump with Avatar of Slimes.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2>🫶</h2>
