-  <p>Hey everyone. Time to announce the <em>Factory</em> contest winners!</p><ul><li><p>🥇<strong>1st Place</strong>: Starmarsh, TheJ_Team, and Daria! Your tentative warp name is `ToyFactory`.</p></li><li><p>🥈<strong>2nd Place</strong>: A tie!</p><ul><li><p>ggDrPepper, lovelychlobug, and theBeezAreComing! Your tentative warp name is `FlowerFactory`.</p></li><li><p>JoshRallus, Penrose_Paradox, and SojournerBurns! Your tentative warp name is `Sinclairs`.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🥉<strong>3rd Place</strong>: Bobola0! Your tentative warp name is `KelpiesFactory`.</p></li><li><p>🏅<strong>Honorable Mentions</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>ElectrixSparx, whose tentative warp name is `Metalworks`.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Thanks to all who submitted. Your prize bundles are in your ender chests, and let us know if you want your warp renamed. Based on discussions in <a href="https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/138080509577134081">#feedback-and-suggestions</a> I&#x27;ve given warps for all entrants this time. Let us know what you think; if it works out we&#x27;ll apply it retroactively to prior contests from this map.</p><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🎄 Reminder that the <em>Days of Christmas</em> event is live! We&#x27;re already on day 2, but there&#x27;s plenty of time to make a fireplace and get all 12 presents.</p></li><li><p>🌎 Added `/toggle creative_world night_vision`  to enable permanent night vision in the creative world.</p></li></ul><h4>🫶</h4>
