-  <p class="post-emphasis">Hey everyone, just a few quick general updates.</p><ul><li><p>⬆️We plan to <strong>update to 1.21.7</strong> within the next day or two. Get your updated clients ready!</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Note that saddles will be removed from the shop when we do this, as they are now craftable. Sell any you have off now if you&#x27;d like!</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🌍The <strong>resource world</strong> has received a few updates</p><ul><li><p>Biome warps now generate with more randomness, and the warp names are now more generic. For example. &quot;ResCold&quot; warps to a semi-random cold biome, like frozen peaks, and &quot;ResForest&quot; warps to a random large forest, like jungles or dark forests. The desert warp is still a mainstay.</p></li><li><p>Warps should be much more likely to generate further apart from each other.</p></li><li><p>This is experimental, so let us know what you think of the general idea!</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🌏Your <strong>creative world inventory</strong> now persists between visits.</p></li><li><p><strong>😴Insomnia</strong> no longer resets if you die in non-survival scenarios.</p></li><li><p>🍯Signs can now be <strong>unwaxed</strong> by right-clicking with an axe. This returns the honeycomb 50% of the time.</p></li><li><p><strong>🛡️Impetus of Athena</strong> effects are rebalanced. Warfare attacks now damage in a cone, while ambush only empowers the attack used to exit stealth, so it is now single-target, but it temporarily shreds 50% of their armor. Stare additionally costs +1 Aegis versus players.</p></li><li><p>🗓️Reminder that the <strong>Greenhouse build contest</strong> is due next weekend, and that you can submit entries as early as you&#x27;d like!</p></li></ul><p>Please leave feedback on any changes in ⁠💌feedback-and-suggestions, thanks🫶</p>
