--- a/src/content/posts/general-updates.html
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,15 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-  <p class="post-emphasis">Hey everyone! Hope your shrine builds are going well. Normally I try to keep the general updates to once/week, but there were enough changes recently or missed in prior announcements that I wanted to get some info sent out. Without further ado!</p><h4>⚔️mcMMO</h4><ul><li><p>Added 5 new potions brewable at the upper Alchemy tiers:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Level 625</strong>: <em>Glow Berries</em> brew the <strong>Potion of Glowing</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 750</strong>: <em>Shulker Shells</em> brew the <strong>Potion of Levitation</strong>.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Note: AoE Levitation potions have intentionally low durations for combat balance.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Level 875</strong>: <em>Hearts of the Sea</em> brew the <strong>Potion of Conduit Power</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 1000</strong>: New tier! <em>Resin Blocks</em> brew the <strong>Potion of Luck</strong>, and <em>Totems of Undying</em> brew the <strong>Potion of Heroism</strong>, granting Hero of the Village.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Fixed missing names on custom potions. This causes newly brewed custom potions to have new ‘/iteminfo’ IDs&#x27;, so you&#x27;ll need to update shops selling them (sorry!)</p></li></ul><h4>Terminology</h4><ul><li><p>Going forward, all past and future unique items won by players (via Splurges, etc.) will be referred to as <strong>Paragons</strong>, to highlight them as unique, ultimate items. You&#x27;re all pretty good about using our designated terms, so I wanted this to be known!</p></li></ul><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><ul><li><p>Added ‘/display background &lt;r&gt; &lt;g&gt; &lt;b&gt; &lt;alpha&gt;’, each 0-255, for setting text display background colors.</p></li><li><p>Updated <strong>Impetus of Zeus</strong> to display a progress bar towards your next lightning shot.</p></li><li><p>Updated unwaxing copper blocks with an axe to refund honeycomb 50% of the time.</p></li><li><p>Updated levitation chambers to play subtle sounds and prevent activating Rocket Boosting by sneaking while within.</p></li><li><p>Advancement completion is now announced for vanilla ones of Goal or Challenge tier or certain SSS ones. Let us know if you enjoy this change!</p></li><li><p>Fixed Absorption health sticking after the effect expired. Sorry, but this was not intentional.</p></li></ul><h2>🫶</h2>
-
