-  
-  <p>Hey everyone! Appreciate all of you still playing on this map. We&#x27;ve heard the requests for a 2026 Spooky Springs so we&#x27;ve pulled together a new cute area for you all to build, with a Splurge-focused special prize, along with our typical Halloween event.</p><p class="post-emphasis">🍂   <strong>Spooky Springs Build Contest</strong></p><p>This year, you&#x27;ll choose from 12 plots to help build an <strong>autumnal dock town</strong> atop the water, surrounding a witchy lighthouse. We&#x27;re starting with less plots this year since we&#x27;re late into the map, but we&#x27;ll add more if needed.</p><ul><li><p>🗓️ <strong>Due Date</strong>: October 30, 2026 1:59 AM CDT (Exact times can be found on the <a href="/calendar/">Calendar</a>)</p></li><li><p>✏️ <strong>Spooky Springs Guide</strong>: Can be found <a href="https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1426514674404560989">here</a>.</p></li><li><p>🏆  <strong>Special Prize</strong>: The top 3 entrants will start the Splurge at the end of this map with +100,000 Simbucks™.</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis">🌕  <strong>Halloween &amp; Blood Moons</strong></p><p>Our typical Halloween festivities are now active as well. As a refresher:</p><ul><li><p>🍬Through <strong>November 2nd</strong>, extra seasonal mobs will spawn: witches, black cats, bats, and more. Seasonal enemies may drop <strong>treats</strong>.</p></li><li><p>🌑<strong>Blood Moons</strong> activate when a full moon rises in the survival or resource world.</p></li><li><p>🛏️Blood Moons cannot be skipped by sleeping.</p></li><li><p>🩸Stronger enemies appear during Blood Moons, but they drop better loot, including <strong>bonus XP</strong> and <strong>occult items</strong>. <a href="https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1426514932274565280">See here for more details.</a></p></li></ul><h2>🫶</h2>
