+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,15 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-  <p>Hey everyone! The Rune Rush, new relics, and enchant updates for the Mounts of Mayhem Expansion are all now live.</p><p>Final quick overview of the changes and timeline!</p><ul><li><p><strong>🕰️Tier VI surges</strong>, each starting the research for a new spear enchant, will occur at (in PST): </p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 7, 2026 10 AM </p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 7, 2026 3 PM </p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 7, 2026 8 PM</p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 8, 2026 10 AM</p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 8, 2026 3 PM</p></li><li><p class="post-small">March 8, 2026 8 PM</p><ul><li><p>We expect the enchants to be found not <em>too</em> long after their surge is beaten, so be online if you want to witness the discovery. This won&#x27;t be a multi-day discovery process like during the OG event!</p></li></ul></li><li><p>💎The <strong>Valor Shop</strong> contains the new relics <strong>Messina</strong>, a trident-spear hybrid, and <strong>G.A.M.M.A.</strong>, a spear relic which can gather Primordial Dust.</p></li><li><p>📖The <strong>Paradigms</strong> Wrath and Vainglory have been reworked, and Lust has been buffed.</p></li><li><p><a href="/changelog-and-faq/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes/">The FAQ post</a> has been updated with the full, final descriptions of the new relics and reworked enchants.</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis">Hope to see you all online soon for the first event surge! 🫶</p>
-
