diff --git a/src/content/posts/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.html b/src/content/posts/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.html
deleted file mode 100644
index 5121cbc..0000000
--- a/src/content/posts/mounts-of-mayhem-expansion-patch-notes.html
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,15 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-  <h4>🪄Runic Shift Event</h4><ul><li><p>⏫A <strong>Rune Rush</strong> will replace the March 7th - 8th Ominous Rush. This grants +25% rune drops and causes fully failed Runecrafts to return 3 runes.</p></li><li><p><strong>🕰️Six Tier VI</strong> surges will run automatically at the following times(PDT): </p><ul><li><p>March 7, 2026 10:00 AM </p></li><li><p>March 7, 2026 3:00 PM</p></li><li><p>March 7, 2026 8:00 PM </p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 10:00 AM </p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 3:00 PM</p></li><li><p>March 8, 2026 8:00 AM</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🪛Defeated Tier VI apexes drop an <em>Attuned Boundary Fragment</em> which uncovers the research project of a <strong>new spear enchantment</strong> once given to the Arcanum.</p></li><li><p>💎Defeated Tier V apexes drop a standard <em>Boundary Fragment</em> which can be submitted for 50% research project progress.</p></li><li><p>📜The research quest for these projects will reroll immediately upon completion.</p></li></ul><h4>🛡️Valor Shop: Spear Relics</h4><ul><li><p>🦑<strong>Messina</strong>, a new <em>hybrid</em> which starts as the trident <em>Charybdis</em>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>🪛Charybdis</strong> has the mythical trajectory enchant <em>Whirlpool</em>🌟. It leaves <em>Scylla</em> behind in-hand when thrown.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Whirlpool🌟</strong>: Throws fly straight and pull enemies, then slam down and form a suffocating whirlpool.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>🪛Scylla</strong> is a diamond spear with no minimum attack range and with the mythical dash enchant <em>Man-Eater</em>🌟. <em>Charybdis</em> can be collected, replacing Scylla, once no enemies are in its whirlpool.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Man-Eater🌟</strong>: Charges forcibly dash to Charybdis, briefly liquefying terrain. Jabs near the whirlpool pull in enemies and execute at 10% HP, sating 1 hunger.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p>☢️<strong>G.A.M.M.A.</strong>, a diamond spear with the mythical loot enchant <em>Cyclotron 🌟</em>. While moving very fast, drops are atomized, often converting to a Primordial Dust.</p></li></ul><h4>📖Runecrafting: Paradigm Updates</h4><ul><li><p>❤️‍🔥<strong>Paradigm of Lust</strong>: (Buff) Scorn leap range strongly increased. Attacking scorned targets heals your defended ally.</p></li><li><p><strong>🤬Paradigm of Wrath</strong>: (Rework) Your swing becomes a rapid <em>onslaught</em> using all melee hotbar weapons, <em>but</em> your hotbar must <em>all</em> be melee weapons for strikes to land.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Onslaught attacks have 2x speed and ignore mercy frames.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>🪞<strong>Paradigm of Vainglory</strong>: (Rework) Your swings fire as piercing waves, and you can hover at full health, but you strike yourself, bypassing armor, when your waves miss.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Hover: Swing directly up to toggle the hover. It disables once you witness your health fall below full.</p></li></ul></li></ul>
