-
-  
-  <p>Hey everyone - been a bit! Excited to announce our content drop rate related to Mounts of Mayhem, including new discoverable spear enchants, new Valor Shop relics, and a few enchant changes.</p><p>The quick overview is below, but check the full post for a more detailed breakdown: <a href="https://discord.com/channels/97121264988082176/1477756425232056531">here</a></p><h4>📋Overview</h4><ul><li><p>⏫<strong>Rune Rush</strong> - Runs March 7th-8th, triggering <strong>Tier VI</strong> surges which each help begin a new spear enchant research project.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Tier VI surges</strong>:</p></li><li><p>Once started, the projects can be progressed via <em>Boundary Fragments</em> from Tier V surges or a no-cooldown research quest.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>🛡️Valor Shop</strong> - 2 new spear-related relics will be available:</p><ul><li><p>🦑<strong>Messina</strong>, a <em>hybrid</em> which starts as the trident <em>Charybdis</em> and becomes the spear <em>Scylla</em> when thrown, who can dash straight back to <em>Charybdis</em>!</p></li><li><p>☢️<strong>G.A.M.M.A.</strong>, a spear which can crush its victims&#x27; drops into Primordial Dust when you move very fast!</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>📖Runecrafting</strong> - Buffs to <em>Paradigm of Lust</em>, and reworks for <em>Paradigm of Wrath</em> and <em>Paradigm of Vainglory.</em></p></li></ul><p>Thanks so much everyone for your patience with this update, and we hope to see a handful of you next weekend!</p><h4>🫶</h4>
-
