-  <p class="post-emphasis">With the discovery of <strong>Walkman</strong>, the final Runecrafting expansion is complete!</p><p>Thank you all so, so much for your engagement and enthusiasm with not only this event, but truly the entire content update; we couldn’t be happier with the response! We&#x27;d like to wrap with a final special Runecrafting announcement, then a quick look at what’s next. </p><h4><strong>🏅Special Thanks</strong></h4><p>First, as thanks for everyone’s efforts, all researchers will soon receive an ancestral <strong>Boundary Fragment</strong> commemorating your contributions!</p><p>We also extend particular thanks to <strong>four key researchers</strong> who showcased great interest and theorizing. Each will soon receive a unique, ancestral Mythic Rune from the college archives. These runes are relics of other times, now inert and only found in mythical enchants and legends. They are novelties which we hope you will cherish - and thanks to each of you for your outsized contribution to making events like this worthwhile!</p><ul><li><p>❤️@J_, for your ingenuity and discernment of all possibilities, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Prisms</strong>. May it aid your search for other realms.</p></li><li><p>💎@Starmarsh™, for your valor and lasting guidance, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Whispers</strong>. May their voices guide you.</p></li><li><p>📈@TroyTheCrafter, for your great ambition, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Asymptotes</strong>. May it lead you ever upwards.</p></li><li><p>🏅@Maidl, for your prolific longevity, you are granted the <strong>Rune of Silence</strong>. May you be inspired by the persistence of what has always been.</p></li><li><p>🏆As each expansion&#x27;s top discoverer, @J_ and @Starmarsh™ are also granted the <strong>Rune of Singularities</strong>. May it pull you to further greatness.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>📆What&#x27;s Next?</strong></h4><p>The expansion was our big map event, but we have more in the works! No exact timelines yet, but here are some things to look forward to in the coming weeks:</p><ul><li><p>✏️A post from the design team covering how we concepted this expansion, and more Valor lore stories.</p></li><li><p>🔋The return of <strong>runic surges</strong> in a new form.</p></li><li><p>📿A <strong>Charms</strong> drop containing roughly 10 new charms to experiment with.</p></li><li><p>⬆️Rotating <strong>rush weekends</strong> which will give free boosts in various areas. These will happen every weekend!</p></li><li><p>⛏️QoL updates for builders, including updates to ‘/display’ and access to light blocks.</p></li><li><p>⚔️A new <strong>duo BYOG Trial</strong> with unique prizes.</p></li><li><p>⚒️Continued contests and events as long as there is interest!</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis">Thanks again everyone. We love you and couldn&#x27;t do this without the encouragement we get from your enjoyment. It means the world!</p><p class="post-emphasis">-🫶Staff</p>
