-  
-  <p>Rush Weekends are a permanent feature designed to help you make the most of your weekends in Silver Springs. They run every weekend for the full 24 hours of Saturday and Sunday, in Pacific time.</p><p>Each rush activates a set of shared <strong>Core Bonuses</strong>, as well as a random <strong>Wild Bonus</strong> from a list. Below are the <strong>Core Bonuses</strong> of each rush (every weekend!), and the list of known <strong>Wild Bonuses</strong> which have occurred so far.</p><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>✅Core Bonuses</strong></p><ul><li><p>1.25x multiplier on Trial Points, mcMMO XP, Boardwalk tickets, and Rune drops</p></li><li><p>All Valor quests have only a 4-hour cooldown</p></li><li><p>mcMMO diminishing returns cap at 0.5x XP instead of 0.25x</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>⁉️Wild Bonuses</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>🐟River Rush</strong>: Rain lasts longer, and fish are hooked a bit quicker.</p></li><li><p>✨<strong>Lucky Rush</strong>: Gain +3 Luck. Lucky Events will randomly activate.</p></li><li><p><strong>🪙Gold Rush</strong>: Gold drops more from ores, scrap, or striking it rich. Paradigm of Greed is innately active.</p></li><li><p>🪶<strong>Parkour Rush</strong>: Parkour item rewards are reset. Gain +1 innate Rocket Boosting and Blitz level. Grasshopper/Orbweaver have -50% cooldown and reset rocket boosts when used successfully. </p></li><li><p>🚽<strong>Void Rush</strong>: All possible locales are corrupted and drop slightly more runes, and rarely, something else... Eldritch Inclination is innately active.</p></li><li><p><strong>😱Ominous Rush</strong>: Ominous Vaults, Pillager raids, and Tier III+ Surges can award Badges of Valor.</p></li><li><p><strong>🧠Experience Rush</strong>: XP drops are doubled and Mending repairs quicker.</p></li><li><p>🥖<strong>Lunch Rush</strong>: Mobs that drop food drop 1 more. Taste Test is innately active. During lunchtime in the main overworld, food grants +50% saturation and Silver Springs Village vendors are 25% off.</p></li></ul>
-
