-
-  
-  <p class="post-emphasis">Hey everyone. Here to give a quick reminder and update on Spooky Springs and a few general updates.</p><h4>🍄‍🟫Spooky Springs</h4><ul><li><p>Reminder that there&#x27;s still about 12 days for Spooky Springs, which is plenty of time to make a build. A number of plots are still open!</p></li><li><p>We&#x27;ve also decided to add some prizes. These are in addition to the standard and special prizes already announced:</p><ul><li><p>🎃The top 3 builds will earn the <strong>Pumpkin Mask</strong> charm, which grants -20% detection range and stops Endermen from angering at your sight.</p></li><li><p>🍬ALL entrants will receive the <strong>Treat Bag</strong> charm, which allows mobs to sometimes drop Halloween treats even outside of the season.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>We recently doubled the build contest entry prize to 50k silver and 4 Badges of Valor. A simple Spooky Springs build gets you both of those <em>and</em> a Treat Bag!</p></li></ul><h4>📝General Updates</h4><ul><li><p>🤖The Moments runic spell now progresses Copper Golem oxidization. It takes <em>many</em> casts to fully oxidize them, but it&#x27;s far faster than the hours it takes otherwise.</p></li><li><p>🧙 Fixed some <em>Pointy Hat</em> trades not giving the correct number of potions.</p></li><li><p>🐈‍⬛ Fixed some special Halloween spawns appearing in unexpected areas.</p></li></ul>
-
-
