@@ -1,17 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-    
-  
-  <h4>🍄‍🟫<strong>Spooky Springs Voting</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Now that the build phase is complete, you can go <strong>vote</strong> for your top 3 Spooky Springs plots.</p></li><li><p>To vote, stand in a plot and use `/halloween vote &lt;1st, 2nd, or 3rd&gt;`. Tab completion is available.</p></li><li><p>You can change your votes freely by re-casting them, and you don&#x27;t need to vote for all 3 placements. You can&#x27;t vote for your own plot.</p></li><li><p>Thanks to all who have entered!</p></li></ul><h4>📝<strong>General Updates</strong></h4><ul><li><p>💡Added `/creative_world light_wand`, which can be used in the creative world to spawn an infinite stack Polaris.</p></li><li><p>🖼️Paintings can once again be changed in a stonecutter.</p></li><li><p>👮Copper bars and chains can once again be scraped with an axe to unwax or deoxidize them.</p></li><li><p>🏹 <em>Whispering</em> once again does its bonus damage on overcharged shots.</p></li></ul><h4>❤️Personal Note</h4><p>Apologies for the above bugs - on a personal note, Bec and I got married last Thursday, the 23rd, so we&#x27;ve been a bit busy as you can imagine!! Thanks for the various congrats and well wishes from those who have already heard. ☺️ </p><p class="post-emphasis">Much love everyone 🫶</p>
-
