diff --git a/src/content/posts/trusted-promos-and-general-updates.html b/src/content/posts/trusted-promos-and-general-updates.html
deleted file mode 100644
index 7432f0b..0000000
--- a/src/content/posts/trusted-promos-and-general-updates.html
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,15 +0,0 @@
-
-  
-  <p>Hey again everyone. Hope you&#x27;re all enjoying the event so far! We&#x27;ve had two discoveries so far - <strong>Mulching</strong> by JenoSnowconeIce, a hoe enchant which automatically composts surplus seeds, and <strong>Pestle</strong> by skelud, a mace enchant which crushes enemies into <em>primordial dust</em> which can be used to dupe gems. Excited to see more discoveries start ramping up!</p><p>We&#x27;ve got a decent batch of people we&#x27;re promoting to <strong>[Trusted]</strong>, and some general updates and fixes from the past week.</p><p class="post-emphasis"><strong>🤝</strong><strong>Trusted Promos</strong></p><p>We&#x27;ve got a big build up of people who have been around a while, play quite often, and have consistently shown good behavior and community involvement. All of the following players are now <strong>[Trusted]</strong> rank - congrats and much love to you all!</p><ul><li><p>Bunniworth</p></li><li><p>ElectricSparx</p></li><li><p>JenoSnowconeIce</p></li><li><p>MareeAM</p></li><li><p>Mishiaria</p></li><li><p>MrHollowPoint99</p></li><li><p>Shotdown01</p></li><li><p>skelud</p></li></ul><p class="post-emphasis">📝<strong>General Updates</strong></p><ul><li><p>We&#x27;ve made many general optimizations to improve performance. Lemme know if the TPS feels better on average!,</p></li><li><p>The boardwalk now sells a Creaking modulator, and the clairvoyant&#x27;s hint is now for a random undiscovered spawn secret instead of always your next one.,</p></li><li><p>Fixed Bane of Arthropods not working on Shulkers, and Kuiper Shulkers duping using the vanilla mechanic. These combined should make Kuiper less annoying!,</p></li><li><p>Displays:</p><ul><li><p>Many cases now show useful info when omitting arguments. e.g. /display brightness with no extra args shows  the brightness of your selected displays.</p><ul><li><p class="post-small">Note /display info exists to show all info about selected displays.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>When setting a text display to fixed billboard mode, it now turns to face your head so you don&#x27;t lose it.,</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Fixed mob scarecrows not placing correctly.,</p></li><li><p>Buffed <strong>Ground Pound</strong> by ensuring it uses pre-roll damage.,</p></li><li><p>Various bugs and compatibility issues fixed, notably for Cerberus and Wrath (still more work to do for them...)</p></li></ul><p>Thanks all!</p>
-
-
-  
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
