-
-  
-    
-  
-  <p>Hey everyone. The server has been updated to 26.3, which covers the <a href="https://minecraft.wiki/w/Java_Edition_26.3">Wilderness Bound</a> game drop. This drop adds a new <em>dappled forest</em> biome with autumnal trees, some exploration-focused features like abandoned camp structures, and plenty of nice new content for builders! ⛺</p><p>This needs little follow-up from us as there are no new mobs, music discs, etc. Our only supporting updates are:</p><ul><li><p>🗺️The resource world has been regenerated. You&#x27;ll need to explore to find a <em>dappled forest</em> this time, but they&#x27;ll potentially appear at `/warp ResForest` going forward.</p></li><li><p>🌳The Lumber shop now buys poplar logs, leaves, and saplings.</p></li></ul><p>As requested by many, we&#x27;ll look to kick off a quick version of Spooky Springs soon, as well as our typical Halloween event content with spookier mobs and blood moons.</p><p>Cheers! 🫶</p>
-
-
-  
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
